# Heavy corpora stay out of git and are re-exportable from data_real + the solver.
# Exception: what the ablation notebook and its test suite load ships in the
# repo (~25 MB), so a fresh clone runs on Colab with nothing else to fetch.
# meta.json (provenance, unused at runtime) and the unused train split of
# ablation2d/data stay out.
ablation2d/data/*
!ablation2d/data/test.npz
!ablation2d/data/val.npz
!ablation2d/data/real_slice.npz
!ablation2d/data/DATASHEET.md
ablation2d/data_liver/*
!ablation2d/data_liver/*.npz
!ablation2d/data_liver/DATASHEET.md
!ablation2d/data_liver/MASKED
ablation2d/data_real/
ablation2d/data_v1/
ablation2d/data_v2synth/
ablation2d/data_vessel/
ablation2d/data_vessel_wide/

# scratch and logs
__pycache__/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.pyc
*.log
ablation2d/logs/
ablation2d/logs_*.txt
ablation2d/slides/_build.md

# OS
.DS_Store
ablation2d/figures/
